WEBVTT

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:14.280
We have to say goodbye to this castle today.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:15.950
Yeah.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.870
But, you know...

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:24.420
A future filled with nothing but fun
is waiting for us.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.230
It will only have sparkling,

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:31.820
sweet, and soft things.

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:34.970
I know!

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.310
Can I bring this too?

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.980
Of course!

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.650
Let's say goodbye

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:47.750
to all the bitter...

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.660
painful...

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.210
and scary things.

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:56.870
Poor thing.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.920
There's still some thick stuff

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:02.410
left inside you.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:05.160
But don't worry.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.270
I'll...

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:10.650
eat it all.

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:04.140
I must do it.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:08.810
For my and Shio-chan's bright future.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.450
The disgusting past...

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.400
The crime I committed...

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:21.350
I'm going to bury it all away.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:24.630
It's all for our love.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.900
Satou-chan! Satou-chan!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.800
What, Shio-chan?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.290
Auntie.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:02.250
Here. This is for you.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:09.080
It's better if you had this, right?

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:11.890
Satou-chan.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.470
I still love you,

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:18.290
the same way I did on the day I first met you.

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:22.400
-Auntie.
-What?

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:26.190
Goodbye.

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:29.350
Yeah. Goodbye.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.320
It'll be okay. Let's go.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.130
Okay!

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:57.430
Satou-chan... I wonder if you realize

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.890
how you look

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:02.340
when you're with that girl.

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:14.140
It's me.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.040
How long are you going to keep me waiting?

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.250
Hey!

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:23.400
I was abused again...

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:27.030
I've become filthy.

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:31.870
Where are you right now?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.550
I'm at Matsuzaka's apartment.

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:38.330
Apartment No. 305

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.250
-Are you sure?
-I am!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:46.730
Hurry, or else I'll go insane!

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:49.030
Help!

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.480
What's wrong, Satou-chan?

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:01.330
I forgot something.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:03.520
-Your ring?
-Yeah.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:06.090
How could I forget something so important?

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:09.070
Sorry, Shio-chan.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.500
It's okay. Let's go back.

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:13.120
Do we still have time?

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:16.220
Yeah. It'll be fine.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:17.660
Thanks.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:23.420
Apartment No. 305.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.590
-Are you sure?
-I am!

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:33.550
Shio's there too?

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:38.370
Please come. Hurry.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:41.780
How dare you say that.

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:43.540
You tried to trick me.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:46.160
Shio's not there.

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:47.920
I don't care what happens to you.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:49.190
Please!

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:01.330
Wait, Shio!

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.420
-Thanks for waiting.
-Did you find it?

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.590
-Of course.
-Let me see.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:10.860
-Satou-chan, hold out your hand.
-Okay.

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.030
-Here.
-Thanks.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.390
I'll never take it off ever again.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:24.730
This time, we really have to say goodbye.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:27.910
Goodbye, our castle.

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:29.790
-Let's go.
-Yeah!

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:41.390
I wonder if Satou-chan already left the city.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:01.100
Well, then...

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:04.230
Oh, no...

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:07.440
I need to get out of here, now!

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.130
She's not here.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.700
Here we go.

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:25.050
Shio-chan, let's eat breakfast at the airport.

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:27.750
Does the airport have someplace to eat?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:31.190
I looked it up. There are lots of places to eat.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:42.370
Goodbye, little bird.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.500
I wonder if there's a cake shop.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.270
You want cake for breakfast?

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.400
That sounds nice.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.290
-Let's look for one together.
-Okay.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:58.090
Oh, I want to eat Black Forest cake again!

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.590
It was really good.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:01.490
Shio!

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:05.040
Finally...

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.890
I finally found you! I've come to get you!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.340
Wait! Shio!

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:17.630
Give Shio back to me!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.660
Damn!

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:29.980
Satou-chan...

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.870
Let's run away.

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.650
Auntie should be on the move by now.

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:37.790
We can't go upstairs.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:40.170
Let's go to Auntie's apartment first.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:46.010
Shio-chan!

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:50.680
I knew you'd be here!

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:52.850
What are you doing here?

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:54.840
What am I doing?

00:10:54.840 --> 00:11:00.440
I'm getting Shio-chan back from you, Matsuzaka.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.910
It has begun...

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:23.200
Taiyo...

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.340
Shio-chan, this way! Hurry!

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:28.080
Wait, don't go!

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.710
Shio-chan!

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:37.210
Please wait! My angel!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.050
That guy's down there.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.110
Maybe I can still make it around from upstairs...

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:45.910
But...

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:55.290
That girl...

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:56.820
Damn!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:01.340
Shio, where are you? Shio!

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:05.550
Shio!

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:18.800
No. No...

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:30.820
I'm sure there's light at the end of your journey.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.230
So promise me...

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:37.480
that you're going to smile at the end. Okay?

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:01.090
It's not opening!

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:06.050
-You!
-Shio-chan, go outside!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.850
Stop!

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:19.110
Satou-chan! Satou-chan, are you okay?

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:24.920
It's your fault, Satou Matsuzaka.

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:27.070
Let's go home, Shio.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.870
Shio-chan!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.760
Satou-chan! I'm not going.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:34.830
I'm going to stay with Satou-chan!

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:37.510
What are you talking about?

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:40.800
She killed her own friend!

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:41.960
I know.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.790
What?

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.890
Mom is waiting too!

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:50.430
It's okay. I'm going to stay here with Satou-chan.

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.560
You...

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.730
Let's go.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.230
Don't hurt her!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:01.500
No...

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.190
I...

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.800
-Get away from her!
-Satou-chan!

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:10.280
I'm not going to let you take Shio-chan!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.170
Shut up.

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:16.930
It's because of you...

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:18.370
That's why Shio--

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:21.600
Stop!

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:24.020
Don't hurt Satou-chan!

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:26.880
I don't care about my family.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:29.050
I care about Satou-chan most!

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.780
Shio...

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:34.450
Really? You...

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.740
You must be mad at Mom...

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:39.830
I heard from Mom.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:43.040
She said she abandoned you.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.900
She said she let go of your hand.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:48.960
You're right. It's unforgivable.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:54.330
But the reason Mom abandoned you
isn't because she hated you.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:15:00.100
Mom realized this
when she hit you that day.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:04.920
She realized she had started to become
just like that horrible man.

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:11.800
That's why she needed to be away from you!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:17.030
She was afraid of turning into someone terrible
who would hurt you.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:20.980
On that day...

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:25.750
Mom came home right after abandoning you.

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:00.410
That kid's so late.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.850
Come on.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:08.130
Damn!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.380
Mom's the one who killed that devil!

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:21.460
She sacrificed herself to protect us.

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:26.380
I wanted to tell you.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:30.480
I can't blame her.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:35.300
Mom is a victim, just like us.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.030
Please...

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:39.610
come with me.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:43.240
Mom committed a crime. I'm sure they'll arrest her.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:46.370
At least hold her hand in the end.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:48.230
It'd be too cruel if you didn't.

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:51.530
Then what about when
she said she didn't need me?

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:54.000
"Shio doesn't need me anymore"!

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.880
That's what Mom said!

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:58.080
She'd never say she doesn't need you!

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:02.090
Brother...

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:03.790
Shio-chan.

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:07.800
-Shio.
-Tell Mom...

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:12.650
Tell her thanks for releasing me from an unhappy life.

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:16.510
That's why I'm going to live for myself!

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:19.890
Shio?

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.640
Don't come any closer!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.200
Why?

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.230
Why, Shio?

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:31.610
-Shio-chan.
-I chose Satou-chan.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.550
I need Satou-chan.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:37.760
No...

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:43.330
Shio!

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:49.380
Wait, Shio!

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:53.190
Shio!

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.930
Satou-chan, does it hurt?

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.570
I'm fine.

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:02.890
But...

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:06.410
We can't go to our new castle anymore.

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:09.230
-Sorry.
-No, it's okay.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:14.990
I feel the happiest when I'm with you, Satou-chan.

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:17.090
Shio-chan.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:28.260
Hey, Satou-chan. This is what I think...

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:32.390
Back there, when my mom abandoned me,

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:36.090
I think I was dead.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:39.150
I was sad and in pain.

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:42.860
I didn't care about anything. Everything was blank.

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:45.780
But then you came, Satou-chan.

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:51.200
I'm so happy I met you
and was able to live with you.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:53.830
Me too, Shio-chan.

00:18:56.540 --> 00:19:00.040
So I want to be with you, Satou-chan.

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:03.580
I want to be happy together with you at the end.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:07.870
So let's die together, Satou-chan.

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:10.430
Shio-chan.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.490
I didn't know...

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:25.950
what warmth felt like...

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:30.100
what kindness was...

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:35.440
or what affection was.

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:38.370
And more than anything else,

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.410
I couldn't understand

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:43.700
what love was.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:49.120
It's all thanks to Shio-chan.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:55.400
It's because Shio-chan took my hand
that one time.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:20:00.050
Shio-chan led me.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:06.100
I learned what happiness meant
for the first time in my life.

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.100
I never understood love before.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:15.120
But Shio-chan is the one who taught me
what love means.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.050
Satou-chan!

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:50.240
I see!

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:54.160
This is an even deeper feeling for Shio-chan.

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.520
I... finally...

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.590
Shio-chan.

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:09.510
I hope you still love me when we're reborn.

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:15.640
I'm sorry...

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:17.290
and thanks.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.900
This is an update regarding the apartment
building that collapsed a few days ago.

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:34.430
The burned body found on the 12th floor
where the fire started, was identified as Shoko Hida.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:39.830
The person who fell from the roof of the building
was identified as Satou Matsuzaka.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:44.150
Matsuzaka's aunt is a suspect in this crime.

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:48.710
Yes!

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:51.290
It was me!

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:55.370
No! No, there's been a mistake!

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:59.290
No! This is bad!

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:10.140
Beautiful... Dirty... Cute... Ugly...

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:15.260
Shio-chan, my angel...

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:16.870
up in the sky.

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:27.710
The moon's still there in the blue sky.

00:22:27.710 --> 00:22:30.960
It's so faint it looks like it's about to disappear.

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:34.410
It's doesn't light up anything anymore.

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:38.640
But from now on, I...

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:50.570
I'm coming in.

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:57.410
Shio... How do you feel?

00:23:00.910 --> 00:23:04.440
It's okay. There's nothing to be afraid of anymore!

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:06.710
We'll be here forever.

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:11.920
So...

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:14.340
Let's live together, Shio.

00:23:17.550 --> 00:23:19.790
Sorry.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:23.310
I don't do that stuff anymore.

00:23:23.310 --> 00:23:28.260
I've been reborn.

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:32.230
What?

00:23:32.230 --> 00:23:35.100
My love... My happiness...

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:38.560
exists only inside of me.

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:50.290
I don't know why Satou-chan kept me alive.

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:53.620
I'm going to keep thinking about it forever.

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:57.720
Forever and ever and ever...

00:23:59.470 --> 00:24:02.500
We're together forever, Satou-chan.

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:04.940
This is my...

00:24:04.940 --> 00:24:07.270
happy sugar life.
